# Prompt library

Reusable prompts for Give or Take. Paste them as-is, or fill the `<>`
placeholders first. Each one is written to be self-contained — an assistant
with no other context should be able to act on it.

**Keep this file honest.** If a rule in `lib/questionRules.ts`, `lib/types.ts`
or `AGENTS.md.txt` changes, the prompt that repeats that rule is now wrong.
Fix it here at the same time.

## Contents

- [1. Draft new questions](#1-draft-new-questions)
- [2. Fact-check a question pack](#2-fact-check-a-question-pack)
- [3. Balance a daily set](#3-balance-a-daily-set)
- [4. Codex / agent task brief](#4-codex--agent-task-brief)
- [5. Category icon generation](#5-category-icon-generation)
